    "substitutions": "PWT 10.01 retrieved via dataverse.nl/api/access/datafile/354095?format=original&gbrecs=true (same DOI 10.34894/QT5BCC as paper); verified rgdpna/rgdpo identical to 10.0 vintage, rnna differs minimally. Implemented TWFE as two-way LSDV OLS with country+year dummies clustered by country (paper Huber-White) \u2013 robust SEs slightly larger but coefficients identical. Implemented DCCEP pooled OLS with country FE plus cross-sectional averages bar_y_t..bar_y_{t-3} (bar_k equivalents for capital) using OLS SVD pinv for collinear averages when factor trended (paper generalized inverse). Implemented DCCEMG as mean-group of country OLS with bar_y_t..bar_y_{t-4} (paper q_T=4>p_T=3) plus country-specific lags, averaging phi=-coeff y_{t-1}; SE via MG variance as paper eq16. Mean lags (1-phi-psi1-psi2)/phi with delta SE from cov matrix. Lag orders p_T=3 s_T=3/4 as Tables 2-3. Democracy and time-invariant z_i not rebuilt due to gated replication data \u2013 listed in not_rebuilt."
